@Code
    ViewData("Title") = "Handmade Bobble Heads | Hand Painted Figurines – India Bobbles"
End Code

@section meta
    <meta name="description" content="We are happy to provide you handmade painted bobble heads & figurines based on India. Visit our website to see some recent samples bobbleheads we have manufactured." />
    <meta name="Keywords" Content="handmade bobbleheads, hand painted figurines" />
End Section

@section head
    <style>
        
    </style>
End Section

<div class="ib-story">

    <!-- ============ Hero ============ -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container py-5">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
                <div class="col-md-9">
                    <span class="kick">Our story</span>
                    <h1>Grown-ups who <em>never really grew up.</em></h1>
                    <p class="mb-0">So you landed all the way here to know our story, right? Well, first things first. We are designers and makers of bobbleheads and figurines inspired by India, and every single piece is hand-painted.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-3 text-md-end d-none d-md-block">
                    <span class="badge-cup"><i class="fa fa-coffee" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ What we make ============ -->
    <section class="sec pb-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-4">
                <span class="kick">What we make</span>
                <h2>Little pieces of India, one bobble at a time</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="make">
                    <span class="e">
                    <img src="//indiabobbles.com/theme/khichdi/img/Gandhi-Bobblehead-Faceonly.jpg" style="max-width:50px;max-height:50px;border-radius:25px;" />
                        </span><b>National leaders</b><span>Icons who inspired a nation</span></div></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="make">
                    <span class="e"><img src="//indiabobbles.com/theme/khichdi/img/chhote-bachchan-faceonly.jpg" style="max-width:50px;max-height:50px;border-radius:25px;" />
                        </span><b>Bollywood look-alikes</b><span>Fictional characters with filmy swag</span></div></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="make"><span class="e"><img src="//indiabobbles.com/theme/khichdi/img/master-blaster-faceonly.jpg" style="max-width:50px;max-height:50px;border-radius:25px;" /></span><b>Sports stars</b><span>The country's favourite heroes</span></div></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><div class="make"><span class="e"><img src="//indiabobbles.com/theme/khichdi/img/nazabattu-faceonly.png" style="max-width:50px;max-height:50px;border-radius:25px;" /></span><b>Comic characters</b><span>Our own originals, like Daku Sambhar Singh</span></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ The story ============ -->
    <section class="sec">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="chapter">
                <span class="kick">Here goes the story…</span>
                <h2>Do we ever really grow up?</h2>
                <p>It sure doesn't mean you have to give up the habit of keeping your favourite toys and <a href="~/collectibles">collectibles</a>. Raj was forced to! To grow up, to earn, to take responsibility. But the child within was in an utter state of denial. And that's when the insanity took over…</p>
                <p>Out of Raj's love for small, fun, collectible things, India Bobbles was born. Once the idea was shared at home, there was no looking back. We loved the idea of creating these amazing little things ourselves. Our very first piece was just for us to savour. The making loads and selling part came later.</p>

                <div class="quote">
                    "We just adore small things. They may not matter, but they're the things that count."
                    <small>They take up less space, and they have the power to bring happiness and inspire big time!</small>
                </div>

                <p>While browsing amazing collectible brands like Royal Bobbles, Funko and NECA, we wondered: why couldn't we own a piece of our favourite hero in the form of a miniature, in the much-loved <a href="~/blog/history-and-evolution-of-the-bobble-head">bobblehead</a> format? So we branched out of <a href="https://www.rudrasofttech.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rudra Softtech LLP</a> (Raj's software company) to make these little fun things for our fellow Indians.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ Tanjore + head nod ============ -->
    <section class="sec tanjore">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-md-5">
                    <a class="pic d-block" href="~/blog/the-bobble-head-and-the-great-indian-head-wobble-connection">
                        <img src="//www.indiabobbles.com/drive/IB New Folder/About/Tanjore-Doll.jpg" alt="Traditional Tanjore dancing dolls" loading="lazy" />
                        <span class="cap">Tanjore dolls, the original bobbleheads?</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-7">
                    <span class="kick">Made in India, before it was cool</span>
                    <h2>The idea came from the West… or did it?</h2>
                    <p>We're pretty sure our world-famous <b>Tanjore dolls</b> gave birth to the concept. Remember the dancing <i>mitti ki lady</i> we brought home for Diwali?</p>
                    <p>One could say we took the "I wanna take you home" idea quite literally! Tell us you've never wanted to keep a piece of your favourite hero, superhero, zombie or any creature by your side, to play with, talk to or be inspired by. That's the joy we try to bring you.</p>
                    <div class="nod">
                        <p><b>And then there's the Great Indian Head-Nod.</b> Yes, the head "bobble" we Indians are famous for. Sometimes it means yes, sometimes no, and sometimes maybe. Which came first, the bobblehead or the nod? <a href="~/blog/the-bobble-head-and-the-great-indian-head-wobble-connection">Find out here →</a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ Values ============ -->
    <section class="sec">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-4">
                <span class="kick">What we believe</span>
                <h2>Every piece has a story to tell</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="val"><i class="fa fa-paint-brush" aria-hidden="true"></i><h5>Hand-crafted &amp; hand-painted</h5><p>Every India Bobbles piece is crafted and painted by hand, so no two are exactly alike.</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="val"><i class="fa fa-book" aria-hidden="true"></i><h5>Stories worth keeping</h5><p>Personal, historical or even a brag. Each bobblehead carries a story, and we love telling them, in our <a href="~/blog">comics and blog</a> too.</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="val"><i class="fa fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i><h5>Gifts to remember</h5><p>Why buy just any <a href="~/blog/most-thoughtful-and-unusual-gifts-for-those-you-love">gift</a> and get it over with? Give a loved one (including you!) a thought to remember.</p></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="sec pt-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cta">
                <h2>Go ahead, your inner child will jump for joy 🎉</h2>
                <p>Grab one, or a whole collection, of our collector's delights. Inspiration and happiness for keeps. Free shipping across India.</p>
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-ibp" href="~/tag/collectibles">Shop bobbleheads <i class="fa fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                    <a class="btn btn-ibo" href="~/order-custom-bobbleheads">Make a custom one</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>